''"Seal" redirects here. For the Curiosity, see [[Great Wax Seal]].''

'''Seals''' are considered one of the fastest animals in the game.
<!--{{MT|m=old|<s>Only [[Snekkja|Snekkjas]] and [[Knarr|Knarrs]] of higher quality are able to outpace a Seal in water.</s>}} (Disabled outdated info. In need of rewrite.)--> 

Seals are able to inflict [[Seal Finger|Seal Finger]] [[wounds]] with their attacks, additionally these can also be obtained from butchering their corpses. The chance for wound from butchering is reduced if wearing [[Poor Man's Gloves]] or [[Plate Gauntlets]].

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Passive until you aggro them.

