===Strategy===

Seals are not tough opponents, their only advantage is their speed, which will be drastically reduced when taken on land. Even a [[Hearthling]] without a horse can deal with a Seal outside of water

While on Horse, Seals pose no threat to any player with at least basic knowledge of combat and relatively low stats.

If fought from a ship, and the retreating Seal is faster than you, break aggro and quickly initiate combat with them again, doing so will cause the Seal to return to combat, just to receive a finish blow from you.

